            "description": "Watch Barcelona SC vs Boca Juniors highlights and goals from CONMEBOL Libertadores on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on May 6, 2026. High tension and physical challenges defined the evening as Barcelona SC hosted Boca Juniors in a gripping encounter for the CONMEBOL Libertadores . Played on May 6, 2026, the match served as a testament to the unpredictable nature of continental football, where tactical plans were constantly disrupted by disciplinary volatility. First-Half Turbulence The match started with high energy, but the flow was repeatedly interrupted by a flurry of cautions. The drama reached a boiling point in the 33rd minute when Santiago Ascacibar was issued a red card, putting Boca Juniors under immense pressure. The numerical disadvantage did not last long, however, as Milton Aaron Celiz was also sent off deep into stoppage time at the end of the first half, leaving both squads to reorganize their strategies during the break. The Decisive Moment The second half saw both sides utilizing their benches to introduce fresh legs and tactical changes. The breakthrough finally arrived in the 73rd minute when Jhonny Quinonez delivered a perfectly weighted assist to Hector Villalba , who clinically finished the chance. Despite a frantic final push from the visitors, the home side maintained their composure to secure the lead until the referee signaled the end of the match."
